    <h1>How to find your TikTok username?</h1>

    <div>Here is a simple guide to find your TikTok username.</div>

    <h3>🌎 On the Web</h3>
    <ol>
        <li>Open TikTok in your browser</li>
        <li>Click on your profile picture in the top right corner</li>
        <li>Click on "Profile"</li>
        <li>Copy the @username from the URL and enter it on the TikFinity Setup page!</li>
    </ol>

